<item>
<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-22T01:40:26.440Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:40:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian IRGC has vowed an offensive invasion while Houthi attacks have prompted the US to order some personnel to leave Saudi Arabia and to withdraw diplomats amid threats to the King Fahd airport, where one person was killed and eight injured. The IRGC also carried out drone and artillery strikes in Iraqi Kurdistan following the appointment of a new defence minister. Lavrov visited Tehran and publicly backed Iran, raising questions about Moscow’s role in the conflict. There were 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/f39aa4d2-e290-451f-ae91-b19138b6172f?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/22/iran-war-live-irgc-vows-invasion-as-defence-doctrine-turns-offensive?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2026/oct/21/strait-of-hormuz-life-amid-wartime-iran&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/21/us-orders-departure-of-personnel-from-saudi-arabia-citing-houthi-threat&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/22/us-diplomats-told-to-leave-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-attacks&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/one-killed-eight-injured-in-attack-on-saudi-arabias-king-fahd-airport-2?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
